about=subhero('Specialised care. A personal connection.','Root Canal & Orthodontic Centre in Moozhikal, Kozhikode.')+f'''<section class="container section two-col" id="approach"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</span><h2>Your smile.<br>Our shared purpose.</h2><p>Cosmopolitan Dental Care brings together a panel of dental professionals and a broad range of services, from everyday dental checkups to root canal treatment, orthodontics and smile designing.</p><p>Our motto is simple: <strong>Specialized Dentistry, Personalised Care.</strong> We take time to understand your concerns, explain your options and plan care around your needs.</p>{button()}</div>{img('consultation','Illustrative photograph of a dentist caring for a patient')}</section><section class="pale"><div class="container section mission-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">Our mission</span><h2>Kindness.<br>Hygiene. Trust.</h2><p>To help our patients achieve the dental and oral health they need through an atmosphere of kindness, hygiene and trust.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">Our vision</span><h2>Care that<br>keeps growing.</h2><p>To meet our patients’ dental needs with compassion, keep learning as dentistry evolves and create an environment of care and empathy.</p></article></div></section><section class="container section" id="team"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our panel of doctors</span><h2>People who care<br>about your smile.</h2><p>Our panel brings together expertise across dental specialities.</p></div></div><div class="doctor-grid">{''.join(f'<article class="doctor"><span class="doctor-initials" aria-hidden="true">{name.replace("Dr. ", "").split()[0][0]}{name.split()[-1][0]}</span><h3>{name}</h3><span class="qualification">{qualification}</span><p>{role}</p>{"<small>Reg. No.: "+reg+"</small>" if reg else ""}</article>' for name,qualification,role,reg in team)}</div><p class="panel-note">Please contact the clinic to confirm the availability of a particular clinician.</p></section>'''+cta()
